y asking and hands it to one narrow agent instead of a single expensive general-purpose call."},{"label":"Guideline-grounded knowledge layer","detail":"Anchors every model output to approved national medical guidelines rather than open-ended generation."},{"label":"Deterministic safety validation rules","detail":"Re-checks AI output against hard rules for vaccine schedules, dosage, and danger signs before it reaches a worker."},{"label":"National health data pipeline","detail":"Aggregates inputs from thousands of distributed field devices into a single real-time view."},{"label":"Policymaker analytics interface","detail":"Lets non-technical stakeholders ask questions in plain language and get a context-aware visualisation back."}]}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"mb-3 text-[12px] text-faint","children":"Stack"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"flex flex-wrap gap-2","children":[["$","span","Python",{"className":"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-md border border-line px-2.5 py-1 text-[12px] text-muted","children":[["$","svg",null,{"stroke":"currentColor","fill":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"0","role":"img","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","className":"h-3.5 w-3.5 shrink-0","aria-hidden":"true","children":["$undefined",[["$","path","0",{"d":"$23","children":[]}]]],"style":{"color":"$undefined"},"height":"1em","width":"1em","xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"}],"Python"]}],["$","span","FastAPI",{"className":"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-md border border-line px-2.5 py-1 text-[12px] text-muted","children":[["$","svg",null,{"stroke":"currentColor","fill":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"0","role":"img","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","className":"h-3.5 w-3.5 shrink-0","aria-hidden":"true","children":["$undefined",["$L24"]],"style":{"color":"$undefined"},"height":"1em","width":"1em","xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"}],"FastAPI"]}],"$L25","$L26","$L27","$L28","$L29","$L2a"]}]]}],"$L2b","$L2c"]}]
